# Sentinel of Lost Lore: "Return target card you own in exile that has an Adventure to your hand" (CR 700.2, 715.2). Exile holds Bot1's Memnite (Swords to Plowshares: a card it owns, no Adventure), Bot1's Bonecrusher Giant (on its adventure) and Bot2's Giant (not Bot1's). Only the Giant Bot1 owns is a legal target, so it is chosen
# alone and returns to Bot1's hand; the other two stay in exile, and Bot2's graveyard (the Bolt) is untouched.

